<p style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px); font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-muted)">Engineer. Hackathoner. Rider.</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 340px; max-width: 440px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; color: var(--text)">10+ years working with and building distributed, event-driven software across fintech (Gojek, Paytm Insider) and AI products (QuillBot, InkersAI), with a USPTO patent along the way.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; color: var(--text)">I mentor engineers and build open, collaborative teams that ship user-centric products.</p>
<a href="mailto:prakash.upadhyay93@yahoo.com" style="align-self: flex-start; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 44px; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none">Get in touch<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a>
</div>
